Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}園中全部樹的果實 可以隨意拿來吃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:12.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}但是 善惡和知識的樹的果實 決不能拿來吃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.06,0:00:16.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}吃的話必定會死
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:23.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}但最終 在共同被創造出來的野生動物中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}最聰明的蛇如是說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:32.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}決不會死
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}吃的話就可以睜開眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.05,0:00:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}同神一樣知道善惡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.35,0:00:42.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}這件事情神是知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.92,0:00:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}然後最開始的那個人就吃掉了那個果實
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:54.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}我們在不久前才經歷了慘痛的戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}在那時候就應該已經起誓過了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}這樣的事情不要再重複了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.51,0:01:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}快住手 你這白癡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.94,0:01:06.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}你那時候不是也在艦橋嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.28,0:01:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}那就應該知道這是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.78,0:01:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}這是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.42,0:01:15.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.21,0:01:17.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}難道是讓我再回到ZAFT嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}你戰鬥了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.26,0:01:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}這到底是怎麼一回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.36,0:01:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}這種稱得上愚蠢的悲劇的重複
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.97,0:01:32.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}不過在有敵人的威脅的時候就沒有辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:36.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}應該戰鬥的時候不戰鬥的話無論什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}就連自己也保護不了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}我不想出手 不要逼我出手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}別淨說這種自以為是的漂亮話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.45,0:01:51.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}但是 卡嘉莉現在正在哭泣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.99,0:01:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}討厭情變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.96,0:01:55.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}因此正在哭泣看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:58.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}不過現在到了該結束時候了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}你要由我擊落
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.47,0:02:09.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}就是今天 在這裏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.97,0:02:12.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}能夠瞭解真相的時候……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.18,0:02:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}米亞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.21,0:02:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}是你不好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}因為 因為你背叛了才……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.45,0:02:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}所有的答案其實大家已經找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.01,0:02:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}我賭上人類的存亡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}以最後的防禦策略的形式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.33,0:02:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}在此宣佈實施DESTINY PLAY
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.07,0:03:13.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}大天使號 出發
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.55,0:03:24.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}基拉 大和 FREEDOM出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:29.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}阿斯蘭 薩拉 JUSTICE 出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}雷 查 巴勒路 LEGEND 出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}真 飛鳥 DESTINY 出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.17,0:03:49.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}基拉 大和 絕對不能原諒你的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.91,0:06:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}雷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.17,0:06:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}FINAL PLUS 被選擇的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:14.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}集中攻擊永恆號
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.68,0:06:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}那是旗艦 別的可以回頭再攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:17.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:21.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}奧布的殘存部隊也不能放過
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.63,0:06:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}ZAFT MS軍接近 數量20 位置顯示
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体} Green 18 Bravo
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:33.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}轉舵10 偏移5 主炮瞄準
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:35.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}別讓它們盯住
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.11,0:06:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}保護永恆號
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:41.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}Kulintos發射
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}這可不好辦了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.83,0:07:05.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}奧布艦隊怎麼樣了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}鎮魂曲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}Meliechult沉沒 Mtolangtone脫離前線
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:14.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体} Susanoo Kusanagi Tsukuyomi 信號確認
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:16.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}剩下的就不行了 狀況混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}Carvern隊 道路clear 請出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}接下來 Gironde隊Ravensworth隊 請
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.40,0:07:35.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体} Red 18 Alpha 發現Gondwana MS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.63,0:07:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}正朝奧布的主力艦隊前進
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:40.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.98,0:07:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.84,0:07:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}絕對不讓你們再得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.48,0:07:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}向奧布艦隊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:58.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}被抄了後路嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.15,0:08:00.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}不妙了基拉 這樣的話 鎮魂曲就……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}為什麼這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:14.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}現在不攻擊的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:16.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}過一段時間的話 他們就會重新準備完成的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.51,0:08:26.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}2號平臺到達準備完畢還有160
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.32,0:08:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}新創世紀儲備力量40％
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}奧布要被攻擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:44.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}脈衝高達接近
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}其後方出現密湼瓦號
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.74,0:08:52.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}Neidhardt 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}回避 迎擊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.76,0:09:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}真是難纏的傢伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.33,0:09:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}什麼嘛 每次 每次都
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.67,0:09:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}這樣的話我們也無法行動
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}阿斯蘭你去 大天使號也去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:39.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.29,0:09:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}基拉君
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.09,0:09:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}這裏交給我和永恆號
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}剩下的都向鎮魂曲前進
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:57.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}這是……命令
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}不過 這樣的話 永恆號就……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}比起這艘戰艦奧布更加的重要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}怎麼辦 伊扎克
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}援護永恆號
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.19,0:10:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}那是ZAFT的戰艦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}奧布是對付PLANT的最後手段了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:23.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}失去的話世界就會被吞沒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.07,0:10:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}絕對要保護住
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.34,0:10:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}我們就是為了這個才在這裏的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.78,0:10:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}所以請去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.39,0:10:37.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}阿斯蘭 拉米亞斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.71,0:10:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}請 快點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.35,0:10:41.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}那一定要再會
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.39,0:10:46.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}是啊 一定要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.16,0:10:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}不會讓你們得逞的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}密湼瓦號在做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.81,0:11:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}雷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.63,0:11:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.63,0:11:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}FREEDOM
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}基拉 大和
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.39,0:11:20.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}雷 你知道了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.96,0:11:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}還有一點了 要保護鎮魂曲到底
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:26.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}是的 我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.20,0:11:35.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}真 你和密湼瓦號一起去追大天使號
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.21,0:11:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:40.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}FREEDOM由我來擊落
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.71,0:11:42.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}雷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}你去對付JUSTICE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}那個叛徒 這次一定地幹掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}這就是你的職責
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.93,0:11:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}讓它結束吧 一切的過去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.90,0:12:02.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}好 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:22.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}這是……怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}你是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.76,0:12:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}是的 都要結束
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}這次一定要讓一切都……結束
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}繞到後面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}就算是大型的鐳射
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.25,0:12:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}打不到的話也沒有用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.17,0:12:46.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}是
