Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.86,0:26:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体} 消滅發射口的敵機後
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.93,0:26:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}就向奧布發射結束這場戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.74,0:26:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体} 向全軍傳達
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.31,0:26:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.64,0:26:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}永恆號
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.34,0:26:21.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn黑体}伊紮克·玖
